 class="break-chip">${escapeHtml(label)}<b>${escapeHtml(value)}</b></span>`).join("");
  };

  function focusedLiveAnswer(query, pages, intent, localResult = null) {
    const top = pages[0];
    if (!top) return "";
    const subjectEntries = localResult?.primary ? [localResult.primary] : [];
    const queryTokens = meaningfulWords(qnorm(query)).filter(token => !GENERIC_WORDS.has(token));
    const candidates = pages.flatMap(page => String(page.extract || page.description || "").split(/(?<=[.!?])\s+/).map(sentence => ({ page, sentence: sentence.trim() }))).filter(item => item.sentence);
    const ranked = candidates.map(item => {
      const s = qnorm(item.sentence);
      let score = 0;
      queryTokens.forEach(token => { if (s.includes(token)) score += 5; });
      if (intent === "timeline" && /\b(before|after|during|year|chapter|episode|arc|incident)\b/.test(s)) score += 8;
      if (intent === "location" && /\b(tokyo|kyoto|shibuya|city|school|colony|station|district|japan)\b/.test(s)) score += 8;
      if (intent === "reasoning" && /because|therefore|which|allow|prevent|result|due to/.test(s)) score += 7;
      if (intent === "mechanics" && /by |allows|causes|creates|uses|works|requires/.test(s)) score += 6;
      return { ...item, score };
    }).sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);
    const best = ranked[0]?.sentence || top.extract || top.description;
    const heading = intent === "timeline" ? `When — ${top.title}` : intent === "location" ? `Where — ${top.title}` : top.title;
    const localSection = localResult ? `<div class="answer-section"><h3>Curated answer</h3><div>${localResult.html}</div></div>` : "";
    return `
      <div class="live-source"><i></i> Question-aware live archive</div>
      <h2 class="answer-title">${escapeHtml(heading)}</h2>
      <p class="answer-lede">${escapeHtml(shorten(best, 650))}</p>
      ${localSection}
      <div class="answer-section"><h3>Supporting record</h3><p>${escapeHtml(shorten(top.extract || top.description, 500))}</p></div>
      <a class="source-link" href="${escapeHtml(top.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the full ${escapeHtml(top.title)} record ↗</a>
      <div class="wiki-attribution">Live excerpts are attributed to the fan-maintained Jujutsu Kaisen Wiki and remain subject to its CC BY-SA licensing.</div>
    `;
  }

  performSearch = async function performSearchV3(rawQuery) {
    const query = String(rawQuery || "").trim();
    if (!query) { toast("Type a JJK question first."); return; }

    state.currentQuery = query;
    $("#searchInput").value = query;
    $("#autocomplete").hidden = true;
    $("#queryTitle").textContent = query;

    const results = searchEntries(query);
    const unrestricted = state.spoiler === "anime" ? searchEntries(query, entries) : results;
    const exactAllMentions = directMentionEntries(query, entries).map(item => item.entry);
    const hiddenExact = state.spoiler === "anime" ? exactAllMentions.find(entry => entry.spoiler === "manga") : null;
    const local = hiddenExact ? null : buildSpecificAnswer(query, results);
    const intent = detectIntent(query);
    const primary = local?.primary || results[0]?.entry || null;
    const topScore = results[0]?.score || 0;
    const hiddenBest = hiddenExact ? { entry: hiddenExact, score: 999 } : (state.spoiler === "anime" && unrestricted[0]?.entry?.spoiler === "manga" && unrestricted[0].score >= Math.max(50, topScore + 18) ? unrestricted[0] : null);

    state.currentEntryId = primary?.id || null;
    createBreakdown(query, results);
    $("#answerType").textContent = "Question Engine v3";
    $("#answerContent").innerHTML = loadingAnswer();
    $("#relatedResults").innerHTML = `<div class="empty-state">Tracing subjects, properties, and connected records…</div>`;
    showView("#resultsView");

    if (hiddenBest) {
      const hidden = hiddenBest.entry;
      $("#answerType").textContent = "Manga record protected";
      $("#answerContent").innerHTML = answerShell(
        "This answer is behind the manga spoiler filter",
        `The engine found a strong match for ${hidden.title}, but revealing it could spoil material beyond the anime-safe archive.`,
        [{ title: "Full archive available", body: `Full Manga mode unlocks all ${entries.length} curated records plus the live ${liveArticleCount.toLocaleString()}+ article index.` }]
      ) + `<button class="prompt-chip" data-action="enableManga">Unlock full manga archive</button>`;
      $("#relatedResults").innerHTML = `<div class="empty-state">Manga-connected records are hidden.</div>`;
      state.currentAnswerText = $("#answerContent").innerText;
      return;
    }

    if (local) {
      $("#answerType").textContent = local.type;
      $("#answerContent").innerHTML = local.html;
      const relatedItems = uniqueEntries([...(local.related || []), ...results.slice(1, 10).map(item => item.entry)]).filter(entry => entry.id !== primary?.id);
      oldRenderRelated(primary, relatedItems.map(entry => ({ entry, score: 1 })));
      state.currentAnswerText = $("#answerContent").innerText;
      updateSaveButton();

      const shouldEnrich = state.spoiler === "manga" && navigator.onLine && (local.confidence < 78 || ["timeline", "location", "reasoning", "summary"].includes(intent));
      if (!shouldEnrich) return;
      try {
        const pages = await liveWikiSearch(query, 8);
        if (state.currentQuery !== query || !pages.length) return;
        // Preserve the direct answer. Add live evidence beneath it instead of replacing it.
        const source = pages[0];
        $("#answerContent").insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend", `
          <div class="answer-section">
            <h3>Live archive evidence</h3>
            <p>${escapeHtml(shorten(source.extract || source.description, 450))}</p>
            <a class="source-link" href="${escapeHtml(source.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open ${escapeHtml(source.title)} ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="wiki-attribution">Live excerpts are attributed to the fan-maintained Jujutsu Kaisen Wiki and remain subject to its CC BY-SA licensing.</div>
        `);
        $("#answerType").textContent = `${local.type} + live evidence`;
        oldRenderLiveRelated(pages, source.title);
        state.currentAnswerText = $("#answerContent").innerText;
      } catch (_) {
        // The curated answer remains intact when the network source fails.
      }
      return;
    }

    if (state.spoiler !== "manga") {
      $("#answerType").textContent = "Anime-safe archive limit";
      $("#answerContent").innerHTML = answerShell(
        "No anime-safe answer matched confidently",
        "The unrestricted live index may contain manga spoilers, so it remains locked in Anime mode.",
        [{ title: "Try a more explicit question", body: "Include the exact character, technique, domain, location, arc, or relationship. Example: “What is Jogo’s Domain Expansion?”" }]
      ) + `<button class="prompt-chip" data-action="enableManga">Unlock full manga archive</button>`;
      $("#relatedResults").innerHTML = `<div class="empty-state">Live records are locked by the spoiler filter.</div>`;
      state.currentAnswerText = $("#answerContent").innerText;
      return;
    }

    let pages = [];
    let liveError = null;
    if (navigator.onLine) {
      try { pages = await liveWikiSearch(query, 8); } catch (error) { liveError = error; }
    }
    if (pages.length) {
      $("#answerType").textContent = "Question-aware live answer";
      $("#answerContent").innerHTML = focusedLiveAnswer(query, pages, intent, null);
      oldRenderLiveRelated(pages, pages[0].title);
    } else {
      $("#answerType").textContent = "No confident match";
      $("#answerContent").innerHTML = answerShell(
        "The archive could not resolve that question",
        "No confident curated or live record matched the wording.",
        [{ title: "Make the relationship explicit", body: "Use a structure such as “Who uses ___?”, “What is ___’s domain?”, “Why could ___ not ___?”, “Where did ___ happen?”, or “When did ___ occur?”" }],
        liveError ? "The live archive connection also failed." : "The live archive may be unavailable while offline."
      );
      $("#relatedResults").innerHTML = `<div class="empty-state">No connected records found.</div>`;
    }
    state.currentAnswerText = $("#answerContent").innerText;
    updateSaveButton();
  };

  // Add better example questions without removing the original visual design.
  const promptRow = document.querySelector(".prompt-row");
  if (promptRow) {
    promptRow.innerHTML = `<span>Try asking</span>
      <button class="prompt-chip">What is Hakari’s domain?</button>
      <button class="prompt-chip">Who uses Boogie Woogie?</button>
      <button class="prompt-chip">Why can’t Mahito transfigure Yuji?</button>
      <button class="prompt-chip">Can Megumi use Domain Expansion?</button>`;
    promptRow.addEventListener("click", event => {
      const button = event.target.closest(".prompt-chip");
      if (button && !button.dataset.action) performSearch(button.textContent.trim());
    });
  }

  document.documentElement.dataset.questionEngine = VERSION;
  console.info(`[JJK Archive] Question Engine v${VERSION} active`);
})();
